      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠰᠪᠥᠷᠢᠯᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>tesbürilekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>тэсвэрлэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TESBYRILE-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. To bear, endure, stand, tolerate; to have patience.</definition>
      <page>807</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠰᠪᠥᠷᠢᠯᠠᠺᠥ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠰᠤ ᠺᠡᠷᠡᠭ ᠦᠯᠦ ᠪᠦᠲᠦᠶᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--ky ygei bolbasu kereg yly bytyjy</transcript>
          <definition> Without patience one cannot succeed.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠰᠪᠥᠷᠢᠯᠠᠨ ᠺᠦᠯᠢᠶᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n kylijeky</transcript>
          <definition> To suffer, endure.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
